{"ref":"BDB, אָמֵן","hw":"אָמֵן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָמֵן</span></big>  <strong>adv. verily, truly</strong> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:15-26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.15-26\">Dt 27:15–26</a> (12 times) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.36\">1 K 1:36</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.13\">Ne 5:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.5\">Je 11:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.6\">28:6</a> & doxologies <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.36\">1 Ch 16:36</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:48\" href=\"/Psalms.106.48\">ψ 106:48</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמֵן (ו)אָמֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:22\" href=\"/Numbers.5.22\">Nu 5:22</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.6\">Ne 8:6</a>, & in the doxologies <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:14\" href=\"/Psalms.41.14\">ψ 41:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:19\" href=\"/Psalms.72.19\">72:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:53\" href=\"/Psalms.89.53\">89:53</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:48\" href=\"/Psalms.106.48\">106:48</a>. ἀμήν = <em>Amen:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֹהֵי אָמֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.16\">Is 65:16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <em>God of Amen</em> De Che RVm; cf. Rev 3:14, or <em>God of faithfulness, God of truth</em> (RV) (perhaps read <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹמֶן</span> Che Di).","next":"BDB, אָמָּן","prev":"BDB, אֹ֫מֶן"}